shadi.","enEx":"They study English.","word":"Study"},{"enEx":"I eat lunch at 1pm.","word":"Eat","pos":"Verb","uz":"Yemoq","uzEx":"Men tushlikni soat 1 da yeyman."},{"pos":"Verb","uz":"Yashamoq","uzEx":"Biz Toshkentda yashaymiz.","enEx":"We live in Tashkent.","word":"Live"},{"enEx":"He reads news.","word":"Read","pos":"Verb","uz":"O'qimoq","uzEx":"U yangiliklarni o'qiydi."}],"questionsPrompt":"Ustozingizga 'Present Simple' mavzusida tushunmagan yoki qiziqtirgan kamida 2 ta savolingizni yozing.","errors":["He play football every day -> ✅ He plays football every day (Uchinchi shaxs birlikda fe'lga -s qo'shiladi)","Do she like coffee? -> ✅ Does she like coffee? (She uchun 'do' emas, 'does' ishlatiladi)","I goes to school. -> ✅ I go to school. (I olmoshi bilan fe'lga -es qo'shilmaydi)","They not work here. -> ✅ They do not work here. (Inkor gapda 'do' yordamchi fe'li shart)","She do not speak Uzbek. -> ✅ She does not speak Uzbek. (Uchinchi shaxs birlikda 'does' ishlatiladi)","We likes pizza. -> ✅ We like pizza. (We ko'plik bo'lgani uchun -s qo'shimchasi kerak emas)","Does you live in Tashkent? -> ✅ Do you live in Tashkent? (You uchun 'do' yordamchi fe'li ishlatiladi)","He study English. -> ✅ He studies English. (y harfi bilan tugagan fe'llarda -ies qo'shimchasi qo'shiladi)","My brother eat apple. -> ✅ My brother eats an apple. (Birlikdagi shaxs uchun fe'lga -s qo'shiladi)","They is happy. -> ✅ They are happy. (Ko'plik uchun 'is' emas, 'are' ishlatiladi)"],"reorderItems":[{"correct":"He reads books every day.","words":["every","day","he","reads","books"]},{"correct":"Do you like coffee?","words":["do","you","like","coffee"]},{"correct":"She does not eat meat.","words":["not","she","does","eat","meat"]}],"level":"A1","quiz":[{"opts":["go","goes","going","gone"],"expl":"Uchinchi shaxs birlik (She) uchun fe'lga -es qo'shiladi.","q":"She ___ to school every day.","ans":"goes"},{"opts":["Do","Does","Is","Are"],"q":"___ you like pizza?","ans":"Do","expl":"You olmoshi bilan 'Do' ishlatiladi."},{"q":"He ___ not play football.","ans":"does","expl":"He uchun inkor shakli 'does not' bo'ladi.","opts":["do","does","is","are"]},{"q":"They ___ English well.","ans":"speak","expl":"They ko'plik bo'lgani uchun fe'l o'zgarmaydi.","opts":["speak","speaks","speaking","to speak"]},{"q":"___ she live in London?","ans":"Does","expl":"She uchun savol 'Does' bilan boshlanadi.","opts":["Do","Does","Is","Are"]},{"opts":["drink","drinks","drinking","drank"],"expl":"I olmoshi bilan fe'l o'zgarmaydi.","ans":"drink","q":"I ___ coffee in the morning."}],"name":"Yangi Sinf 06/10/2026","blanks":[{"s":"She ______ (work) in a bank.","a":"works"},{"s":"They ______ (play) tennis every Sunday.","a":"play"},{"a":"Does","s":"______ (do) he speak English?"},{"a":"do not like","s":"I ______ (not/like) spicy food."},{"a":"arrives","s":"The train ______ (arrive) at 9 AM."},{"a":"visit","s":"We ______ (visit) our grandparents often."},{"a":"Do","s":"______ (do) you want some water?"},{"a":"does not go","s":"He ______ (not/go) to the gym."},{"a":"reads","s":"My sister ______ (read) many books."},{"s":"They ______ (live) in a big house.","a":"live"}],"topic":"Present Simple","deadline":"Ertaga 18:00 gacha","slides":[{"tag":"Slide 1: Kirish","title":"Present Simple nima?","body":"<div style='background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.8); padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #334155;'><h3 style='color: #38bdf8;'>Doimiy takrorlanadigan ish-harakatlar</h3><p style='color: #e2e8f0;'>Present Simple — bu bizning kundalik odatlarimiz, umumiy haqiqatlar va doimiy holatlarni ifodalash uchun ishlatiladigan zamon.</p><div style='background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.2); padding: 10px; border-left: 4px solid #6366f1;'><b>Misol:</b> I drink coffee every morning. (Men har kuni ertalab qahva ichaman.)</div></div>"},{"tag":"Slide 2: Formula","title":"Tasdiq shakli (Affirmative)","body":"<div style='background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.8); padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px;'><h3 style='color: #6ee7b7;'>Formula: Subject + Verb (+s/es)</h3><ul style='color: #f1f5f9;'><li>I / You / We / They + <b>work</b></li><li>He / She / It + <b>works</b></li></ul><p style='color: #94a3b8;'>Eslatma: Uchinchi shaxs birlikda (He, She, It) fe'lga <b>-s</b> yoki <b>-es</b> qo'shiladi.</p></div>"},{"title":"Inkor shakli (Negative)","body":"<div style='background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.8); padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px;'><h3 style='color: #fb7185;'>Yordamchi fe'llar: do not / does not</h3><p style='color: #e2e8f0;'>Inkor yasash uchun <b>do not (don't)</b> yoki <b>does not (doesn't)</b> ishlatamiz.</p><div style='margin-top: 10px; color: #f8fafc;'><b>I don't like apples.</b><br><b>She doesn't like apples.</b></div></div>","tag":"Slide 3: Inkor"},{"tag":"Slide 4: So'roq","title":"So'roq shakli (Interrogative)","body":"<div style='background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.8); padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px;'><h3 style='color: #fbbf24;'>Do / Does gap boshiga chiqadi</h3><p style='color: #e2e8f0;'>Savol berish uchun gap boshiga <b>Do</b> yoki <b>Does</b> qo'yiladi.</p><div style='margin-top: 10px; color: #f8fafc;'><b>Do you speak English?</b><br><b>Does he play football?</b></div></div>"},{"title":"Vaqt ko'rsatkichlari","body":"<div style='background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.8); padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px;'><h3 style='color: #a5b4fc;'>Present Simple'ni qanday aniqlaymiz?</h3><ul style='color: #e2e8f0;'><li>Always (har doim)</li><li>Usually (odatda)</li><li>Often (tez-tez)</li><li>Sometimes (ba'zida)</li><li>Every day (har kuni)</li></ul></div>","tag":"Slide 5: Kalit so'zlar"},{"tag":"Slide 6: Xulosa","body":"<div style='background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.8); padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px; text-align: center;'><h3 style='color: #ffffff;'>Endi navbat sizga!</h3><p style='color: #cbd5e1;'>O'z kundalik odatlaringiz haqida 5 ta gap tuzing. Masalan: 'I wake up at 7 o'clock'.</p><button style='background: #6366f1; color: white; border: none; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 5px;'>Mashqlarni boshlash</button></div>","title":"Amaliyot vaqti!"}],"rules":[{"title":"Uchinchi shaxs qoidasi","desc":"He, She, It olmoshlari bilan fe'lga -s yoki -es qo'shiladi.","examples":["He reads a book.","She watches TV."]},{"title":"Inkor va so'roqda o'zgarish","desc":"Does ishlatilganda fe'ldagi -s/-es tushib qoladi.","examples":["Does he work? (not works)","He doesn't work."]}],"translations":[{"hint":"(I, wake up, every morning, at 7)","uz":"Men har kuni ertalab soat 7 da uyg'onaman."},{"hint":"(He, know, English, well)","uz":"U (o'g'il bola) ingliz tilini yaxshi biladi."},{"uz":"Biz dam olish kunlari kinoga bormaymiz.","hint":"(We, not go, to the cinema, on weekends)"},{"hint":"(Do, you, study, at school)","uz":"Siz maktabda o'qiysizmi?"},{"uz":"Mening onam mazali ovqat pishiradi.","hint":"(My mother, cook, delicious food)"},{"uz":"Ular parkda yugurishni yoqtirishadi.","hint":"(They, like, running, in the park)"},{"uz":"U (qiz bola) har kuni kitob o'qiydi.","hint":"(She, read, a book, every day)"},{"uz":"Bizning mushugimiz sut ichmaydi.","hint":"(Our cat, not drink, milk)"},{"hint":"(Where, do, you, work)","uz":"Siz qayerda ishlaysiz?"},{"uz":"Ular har yili yozda dam olishadi.","hint":"(They, have a rest, every summer)"}],"hwMcqs":[{"expl":"Uchinchi shaxs birlik (he/she/it) uchun fe'lga -es qo'shimchasi qo'shiladi.","q":"My brother ______ to school every morning.","ans":"goes","opts":["go","goes","going","gone"]},{"opts":["study","studies","studying","studied"],"expl":"Ko'plik shakli (they) uchun fe'l o'zgarishsiz qoladi.","q":"They ______ English at the university.","ans":"study"},{"opts":["Do","Does","Is","Are"],"ans":"Do","q":"______ you like apples?","expl":"You olmoshi bilan so'roq gaplarda 'do' yordamchi fe'li ishlatiladi."},{"expl":"Inkor gaplarda uchinchi shaxs birlik uchun 'does not' ishlatiladi.","q":"She ______ not play football.","ans":"does","opts":["do","does","is","are"]},{"expl":"Birlikdagi shaxs uchun 'to be' fe'lining 'is' shakli qo'llaniladi.","q":"My father ______ a doctor.","ans":"is","opts":["be","am","is","are"]},{"ans":"eat","q":"We ______ breakfast at 8 o'clock.","expl":"We (biz) ko'plikda bo'lgani uchun fe'lga qo'shimcha qo'shilmaydi.","opts":["eat","eats","eating","eaten"]},{"q":"______ she live in Tashkent?","ans":"Does","expl":"Uchinchi shaxs birlik (she) uchun so'roq gap 'does' bilan boshlanadi.","opts":["Do","Does","Is","Are"]},{"expl":"I (men) olmoshi uchun fe'l o'zgarishsiz qoladi.","ans":"do","q":"I ______ my homework every evening.","opts":["do","does","doing","done"]},{"opts":["rise","rises","rising","risen"],"ans":"rises","q":"The sun ______ in the east.","expl":"Tabiat hodisalari va doimiy faktlar uchun uchinchi shaxs birlikda -s qo'shimchasi qo'shiladi."},{"opts":["do","does","is","are"],"expl":"They (ular) ko'plik olmoshi bo'lgani uchun inkor gapda 'do not' ishlatiladi.","ans":"do","q":"They ______ not watch TV at night."}],"essayPrompt":"O'zingizning kundalik tartibingiz haqida 8-10 ta gap yozing. Har kuni nimalar qilishingizni tasvirlab bering. Masalan: soat nechida uyg'onasiz, nimalar yeyishni yoqtirasiz, maktabga qanday borasiz va bo'sh vaqtingizda nimalar bilan shug'ullanasiz. 'Present Simple' qoidalariga rioya qiling. Gaplaringizni 'I wake up...', 'I eat...', 'I go...' kabi boshlang. O'zingizning maqsadlaringiz haqida ham yozib o'ting. Matnni xatosiz yozishga harakat qiling.","teacherName":"Yangi Sinf 06/10/2026","teacherUsername":"@axror","teacherChatId":"6315515792","enrolledStudents":[],"roomKey":"TOS-NPY8-RNQ6-WYA2"}},"students":[]},"TOS-PY23-9CNY-6J45":{"name":"Yangi Sinf 06/10/2026","students":[],"teacher_username":"@axror","teacher_id":"7957347033"},"TOS-H2V3-KNXT-VGFU":{"teacher_username":"@axror","teacher_id":"6315515792","students":[],"name":"Yangi Sinf 06/10/2026"},"TOS-3SGX-IENT-9VI3":{"name":"CEFR C1","students":[],"teacher_username":"@ulunur","teacher_id":"6315515792"},"TOS-CYCX-G2SC-6B5D":{"teacher_id":"7957347033","students":["7723214137"],"name":"Sinf (TOS-CYCX-G2SC-6B5D)"}